    "chunk_text": "XUIII KALENDAS FEBRUARII NATALE SANCTI MAURI ABBATIS. MAURUS W\u00c6S GEHATEN SUM SWY\u00deE HALIG abbod, se w\u00e6s to lare bef\u00e6st sona fram iugo\u00f0e \u00feam He \u00feeah wel on lare and w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e gehyrsum \u00feam halgan Benedicte on eallum his h\u00e6sum, and on Hwilon \u00e6r we s\u00e6don on sumere o\u00f0re stowe hu se ylca Maurus, \u00feurh godes mihte eode uppon yrnendum On sumne s\u00e6l eode se halga Maurus ham to mynstre weard mid his gebro\u00f0rum. And Benedictus w\u00e6s \u00fea mid anum \u00e6wf\u00e6stum were, for\u00fean \u00fee his wif w\u00e6s mid wodnysse gedreht. And Maurus \u00f0a gemette \u00e6r he to mynstre come \u00e6nne dumbne cnapan and se w\u00e6s creopere eac, ac se Hi feollon \u00f0a butu mid flowendum tearum to Maures fotum and befengon his cneowa, halsigende \u00feurh \u00dea nolde Maurus \u00f0am mannum \u00fe\u00e6s ti\u00f0ian, cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t seo d\u00e6d n\u00e6re him gedafenlic o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea gebro\u00f0ra Hw\u00e6t \u00fea Maurus sona beseah to heofonum and cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00feu ure h\u00e6lend Crist, \u00fee behete \u00feinum \u00c6fter \u00feisum wordum he cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00f0am wanhalan, On \u00fe\u00e6re halgan \u00f0rynnysse naman, beo \u00feu hal, cnapa, \u00dea aras se cnapa and up rihte eode, and mid bli\u00f0re stemne bletsode his drihten, \u00fee hine geh\u00e6lde \u00feurh Eft \u00f0a \u00fea se halga Benedictus ham to mynstre com, and \u00fe\u00e6t wif wear\u00f0 gewittig",
